# Mark real binaries so git never applies EOL conversion / text diffs to
# them (the malicious-fixture payload.exe is a deliberate test binary).
*.exe binary
*.png binary
*.zip binary

# Markdown is authored and reviewed in the repo. Keep it LF on every platform
# so legacy CRLF README blobs cannot reappear and `git diff` shows content
# changes instead of whole-file line-ending churn.
*.md text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
